WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.431
Step 1. Open the questionnaire.

1.2
00:00:02.431 --> 00:00:08.059
You can change its details, or retire it so that staff can no longer fill it in.

1.3
00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:13.625
In Settings, under Forms, select Questionnaires, then the questionnaire.

2.1
00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:15.866
Step 2. Change the details.

2.2
00:00:15.866 --> 00:00:21.175
Under Basic Information, change the Title, the Slug, or the Description.

2.3
00:00:21.175 --> 00:00:24.256
You cannot change the Subject Type.

3.1
00:00:24.256 --> 00:00:30.049
Step 3. Retire the questionnaire. Do this only when staff must stop using it.

3.2
00:00:30.049 --> 00:00:32.137
Under Status, select Retired.

3.3
00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:37.460
The questionnaire screens have no action to delete a questionnaire.

4.1
00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.251
Step 4. Save your changes. Select Save Questionnaire.

4.2
00:00:41.251 --> 00:00:46.062
The version number stays the same, because the questions did not change.

4.3
00:00:46.062 --> 00:00:50.037
A retired questionnaire shows under the Retired tab.
